§§ `s 383 Actions by and against unqualified foreign corporations`

-- (a): a foreign corporation required to comply with ss 371 and 372 that has done business in this State without
-- authority "shall not maintain any action or special proceeding in this State unless and until such corporation has
-- been authorized to do business in this State and has paid to the State all fees, penalties and franchise taxes for
-- the years or parts thereof during which it did business in this State without authority. This prohibition shall not
-- apply to any successor in interest of such foreign corporation." (fork F32: the prohibition lifts only when both
-- the authority and the payment are in place.)
-- src:1924 | (a) A foreign corporation which is required to comply with §§ 371 and 372 of this title and which has done business in this State without authority shall not maintain any action or special proceeding in this State unless and until such corporation has been authorized to do business in this State and has paid to the State all fees, penalties and franchise taxes for the years or parts thereof during which it did business in this State without authority. This prohibition shall not apply to any successor in interest of such foreign corporation.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 383(a) (src:1924)
GIVEN `the foreign corporation is required to comply with ss 371 and 372` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it has done business in this State without authority` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it has since been authorized to do business in this State` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it has paid to the State all fees, penalties and franchise taxes for the years or parts thereof during which it did business in this State without authority` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the plaintiff is a successor in interest of the foreign corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 383(a) the foreign corporation is barred from maintaining the action or special proceeding in this State` `the foreign corporation is required to comply with ss 371 and 372` `it has done business in this State without authority` `it has since been authorized to do business in this State` `it has paid to the State all fees, penalties and franchise taxes for the years or parts thereof during which it did business in this State without authority` `the plaintiff is a successor in interest of the foreign corporation` MEANS
        `the foreign corporation is required to comply with ss 371 and 372`
    AND `it has done business in this State without authority`
    AND (NOT (`it has since been authorized to do business in this State` AND `it has paid to the State all fees, penalties and franchise taxes for the years or parts thereof during which it did business in this State without authority`))
    AND (NOT `the plaintiff is a successor in interest of the foreign corporation`)

-- (b): the failure to obtain authority "shall not impair the validity of any contract or act of the foreign corporation
-- or the right of any other party to the contract to maintain any action or special proceeding thereon, and shall not
-- prevent the foreign corporation from defending any action or special proceeding in this State."
-- src:1925 | (b) The failure of a foreign corporation to obtain authority to do business in this State shall not impair the validity of any contract or act of the foreign corporation or the right of any other party to the contract to maintain any action or special proceeding thereon, and shall not prevent the foreign corporation from defending any action or special proceeding in this State.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 383(b) (src:1925)
GIVEN `the foreign corporation failed to obtain authority to do business in this State` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 383(b) the failure to obtain authority impairs the validity of a contract or act of the foreign corporation` `the foreign corporation failed to obtain authority to do business in this State` MEANS
    IF `the foreign corporation failed to obtain authority to do business in this State` THEN JUST FALSE ELSE NOTHING

@ref 8 Del. C. § 383(b) (src:1925)
GIVEN `the foreign corporation failed to obtain authority to do business in this State` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 383(b) the failure to obtain authority impairs the right of the other party to the contract to maintain an action or special proceeding on it` `the foreign corporation failed to obtain authority to do business in this State` MEANS
    IF `the foreign corporation failed to obtain authority to do business in this State` THEN JUST FALSE ELSE NOTHING

@ref 8 Del. C. § 383(b) (src:1925)
GIVEN `the foreign corporation failed to obtain authority to do business in this State` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 383(b) the failure to obtain authority prevents the foreign corporation from defending an action or special proceeding in this State` `the foreign corporation failed to obtain authority to do business in this State` MEANS
    IF `the foreign corporation failed to obtain authority to do business in this State` THEN JUST FALSE ELSE NOTHING

§§ `s 384 Foreign corporations doing business without having qualified; injunctions`

-- src:1929 | The Court of Chancery shall have jurisdiction to enjoin any foreign corporation, or any agent thereof, from transacting any business in this State if such corporation has failed to comply with any section of this subchapter applicable to it or if such corporation has secured a certificate of the Secretary of State under § 371 of this title on the basis of false or misleading representations. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 384 (src:1929)
GIVEN `the foreign corporation has failed to comply with a section of this subchapter applicable to it` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the foreign corporation has secured a certificate of the Secretary of State under s 371 on the basis of false or misleading representations` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 384 the Court of Chancery has jurisdiction to enjoin the foreign corporation or its agent from transacting any business in this State` `the foreign corporation has failed to comply with a section of this subchapter applicable to it` `the foreign corporation has secured a certificate of the Secretary of State under s 371 on the basis of false or misleading representations` MEANS
        `the foreign corporation has failed to comply with a section of this subchapter applicable to it`
    OR  `the foreign corporation has secured a certificate of the Secretary of State under s 371 on the basis of false or misleading representations`

-- src:1929 | The Attorney General shall, upon the Attorney General’s own motion or upon the relation of proper parties, proceed for this purpose by complaint in any county in which such corporation is doing business.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 384 (src:1929)
GIVEN `the Court of Chancery has jurisdiction under s 384` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Attorney General acts on the Attorney General's own motion or upon the relation of proper parties` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 384 the Attorney General must proceed by complaint in a county in which the corporation is doing business` `the Court of Chancery has jurisdiction under s 384` `the Attorney General acts on the Attorney General's own motion or upon the relation of proper parties` MEANS
    `the Court of Chancery has jurisdiction under s 384` AND `the Attorney General acts on the Attorney General's own motion or upon the relation of proper parties`

§§ `s 385 Filing of certain instruments with recorder of deeds not required`

-- src:1933 | No instrument that is required to be filed with the Secretary of State of this State by this subchapter need be filed with the recorder of deeds of any county of this State in order to comply with this subchapter.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 385 (src:1933)
GIVEN `the instrument is required to be filed with the Secretary of State of this State by this subchapter` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 385 the instrument must also be filed with the recorder of deeds of a county` `the instrument is required to be filed with the Secretary of State of this State by this subchapter` MEANS
    IF `the instrument is required to be filed with the Secretary of State of this State by this subchapter` THEN JUST FALSE ELSE NOTHING
